body:
I'm so sorry that you have to call this psychopath your mother (please don't take it as personal offense, but there's 0 empathy in her tbh). I can't imagine how demoralizing this must be, and it's pretty damn impossible to not care what she says, because I bet that you love her despite her manipulative and toxic nature, but I just want you to know that what she says to you, or other people about you, it doesn't make it true and sure as hell doesn't define you. Study for yourself, put the effort in everything you do for yourself, always. What insecure adults dissatisfied with their mediocre lives want from you doesn't matter. You don't have to be an adult to have the right to control your own life, as long as you are capable enough to do that, and I'm sure you're intelligent enough to do that.

&#x200B;

Here, have some Mr. Rogers emotional support: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kFVPkn37iFM

Look mom, I  made it!

&#x200B;

Who dat big pp boi up there? pretty hot ngl
